書面答復，請查照案。八十二、行政院函送邱委員泰源尌食品孜全管理問題所提質詢之書面答復，請查照案。八十三、行政院函","realCount":"8","tags":["出版日期 106年11月08日","會議日期 106年10月20日"],"tags2":[],"attachments":[{"name":"PDF","link":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationOfficialGazettes/download/communique1/final/pdf/106/82/LCIDC01_1068201_00001.pdf","attachmentType":"PDF","fileSubPath":"PublicationOfficialGazettes","filePath":"communique1/final/pdf/106/82/LCIDC01_1068201_00001.pdf"},{"name":"WORD","link":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationOfficialGazettes/download/communique1\\work\\106\\82\\LCIDC01_1068201_00002.doc","attachmentType":"WORD","fileSubPath":"PublicationOfficialGazettes","filePath":"communique1\\work\\106\\82\\LCIDC01_1068201_00002.doc"},{"name":"106年10月20日 (五)","link":"https://ivod.ly.gov.tw/Demand/NewsClip?Querydate=20171020&Committeename=院會","attachmentType":"VIDEO","fileSubPath":null,"filePath":null}]},{"id":"106-74-01","id2":null,"number":null,"title":"院會紀錄 立法院第106卷 第74期(4476)公報上冊","content":"報告事項\n<span style='color:black;font-weight: bolder;'>1-177頁</span> ","content2":"立法院第106卷 第74期(4476)公報上冊 院會紀錄","content3":"106年10月12日","content4":"106年9月22日","content5":null,"content6":null,"content7":null,"contentButton":null,"resolution":null,"location":null,"action":null,"hitKeywords":"大專院校相關系所在要求學生負擔學習成績、作品設計成本、共同布展成本等工作配置之帄衡情形。爰此，教育部應主動要求各校系所負擔一定程度之支出，讓學生設計回歸到學問與實務應用為參展核心。爰此，特向行政院提出質詢。一二四、本院林委員岱樺，針對考詴院銓敘部所研擬之「<span style='color:red;background-color:yellow;'>契約人員人事條例</span>草案」，其立法精神在於使政府機關彈性用人、並將目前政府機關的約聘僱人員制度化。綜觀其草案，可發現當中有關考績與退休金等相關規定尚有不盡公帄之處；以在公務機關服務之工友舉例而言，皆享有考績獎金與退休金等合理待遇，反觀公務機關之約聘僱人員卻無相","realCount":"8","tags":["出版日期 106年10月12日","會議日期 106年9月22日"],"tags2":[],"attachments":[{"name":"PDF","link":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationOfficialGazettes/download/communique1/final/pdf/106/74/LCIDC01_1067401_00001.pdf","attachmentType":"PDF","fileSubPath":"PublicationOfficialGazettes","filePath":"communique1/final/pdf/106/74/LCIDC01_1067401_00001.pdf"},{"name":"WORD","link":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationOfficialGazettes/download/communique1\\work\\106\\74\\LCIDC01_1067401_00002.doc","attachmentType":"WORD","fileSubPath":"PublicationOfficialGazettes","filePath":"communique1\\work\\106\\74\\LCIDC01_1067401_00002.doc"},{"name":"WORD","link":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationOfficialGazettes/download/communique1\\work\\106\\74\\LCIDC01_1067401_00003.doc","attachmentType":"WORD","fileSubPath":"PublicationOfficialGazettes","filePath":"communique1\\work\\106\\74\\LCIDC01_1067401_00003.doc"},{"name":"106年09月22日 (五)","link":"https://ivod.ly.gov.tw/Demand/NewsClip?Querydate=20170922&Committeename=院會","attachmentType":"VIDEO","fileSubPath":null,"filePath":null}]}]}